%%{init: {'flowchart': {'curve': 'basis', 'nodeSpacing': 35, 'rankSpacing': 50}, 'themeVariables': {'fontSize': '13px'}}}%%
flowchart TD

    Start([Caller dials masked number]):::start
    Start --> C1["<b>Connect — API 1</b><br/>Table 1 + Table 2 by-FROM<br/>returns 1 ticket → destination"]:::connect

    %% First Connect outcomes
    C1 -->|Connected| PA1[Passthru Async]:::passthru
    PA1 --> DB1[(Data saved in DB)]:::store

    C1 -->|DNP — didn't pick| PA2["Passthru Async<br/><i>missed-call hook fires here</i>"]:::passthru
    PA2 --> DB2[(Data saved in DB)]:::store

    C1 -->|Did not Dial| PS1["<b>Passthru Sync — API 2</b><br/>user_identification"]:::sync

    %% Switch Case after first user_identification
    PS1 -->|200| SC1{Switch Case<br/>user_type?}:::switch
    PS1 -->|404| G1

    SC1 -->|Customer| GR1["Greeting<br/>No active ticket<br/>→ call 88803 22222"]:::greeting
    GR1 --> HU1([Hangup]):::hangup

    SC1 -->|CSP| GR2["Greeting<br/>No active ticket<br/>→ call 78368 11111"]:::greeting
    GR2 --> HU2([Hangup]):::hangup

    SC1 -->|Unknown| G1["<b>Gather — attempt 1</b><br/>Prompt for PIN"]:::gather

    %% PIN attempt 1
    G1 -->|No entry| GR3["Greeting<br/>You did not enter anything"]:::greeting
    GR3 --> HU3([Hangup]):::hangup

    G1 -->|Entered| C2["<b>Connect — API 3</b><br/>Table 2 by PIN"]:::connect

    C2 -->|Connected| PA3[Passthru Async]:::passthru
    PA3 --> DB3[(Data saved in DB)]:::store

    C2 -->|DNP| PA4["Passthru Async<br/><i>missed-call hook fires here</i>"]:::passthru
    PA4 --> DB4[(Data saved in DB)]:::store

    C2 -->|Did not Dial| G2["<b>Gather — attempt 2</b><br/>Prompt for PIN"]:::gather

    %% PIN attempt 2
    G2 -->|No entry| HU4([Hangup]):::hangup

    G2 -->|Entered| C3["<b>Connect — API 3</b><br/>Table 2 by PIN"]:::connect

    C3 -->|Connected| PA5[Passthru Async]:::passthru
    PA5 --> DB5[(Data saved in DB)]:::store

    C3 -->|DNP| PA6["Passthru Async<br/><i>missed-call hook fires here</i>"]:::passthru
    PA6 --> DB6[(Data saved in DB)]:::store

    %% Final dead-end after PIN exhaustion
    C3 -->|Did not Dial| PS2["<b>Passthru Sync — API 2 again</b><br/>user_identification"]:::sync
    PS2 --> SC2{Switch Case<br/>user_type?}:::switch

    SC2 -->|Customer| GR4["Greeting<br/>Open the app or<br/>call 88803 22222"]:::greeting
    GR4 --> HU5([Hangup]):::hangup

    SC2 -->|CSP| GR5["Greeting<br/>Open the app or<br/>call 78368 11111"]:::greeting
    GR5 --> HU6([Hangup]):::hangup

    SC2 -->|Unknown| GR6["Greeting<br/>call 78368 11111"]:::greeting
    GR6 --> HU7([Hangup]):::hangup

    classDef start    fill:#37474f,stroke:#263238,color:#fff
    classDef connect  fill:#bbdefb,stroke:#1976d2,color:#0d47a1
    classDef passthru fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#0288d1,color:#01579b
    classDef sync     fill:#90caf9,stroke:#1565c0,color:#0d47a1
    classDef switch   fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825,color:#f57f17
    classDef gather   fill:#e1bee7,stroke:#7b1fa2,color:#4a148c
    classDef greeting fill:#ffe0b2,stroke:#ef6c00,color:#bf360c
    classDef store    fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1b5e20
    classDef hangup   fill:#cfd8dc,stroke:#455a64,color:#263238
